! FORTH.DBG - debugger commands for FORTH (testdata/mar/forth.mar, built
! /DEBUG and linked /DEBUG; docs/PHASE-41.md, subtask 1): a large module
! with system macros' code (the RMS calls at its start), JSB routines,
! and labels the DEFWORD macro defines in another psect. FORTH reads
! the terminal, so it isn't run: the commands only look.
!
SHOW MODULE
SET MODULE/ALL
SHOW SYMBOL/ADDRESS F_A* IN FORTH
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION FORTH:FORTH+60
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION ABORT:ABORT+20
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION %LINE 395:%LINE 400
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION INTERP:INTERP+60
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION LOOKUP:LOOKUP+30
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION F_OVER:F_OVER_E
EVALUATE/ADDRESS F_ABS_H
SYMBOLIZE F_ABS_H+4
SYMBOLIZE INTERP+7
EXAMINE BASE
EXAMINE TTIN
